{"id":"b25c43219b02cae4","group":"62","path":"62/62-df-BoundedFormula.md","title":"Bounded Arithmetical Formula","display":"df-BoundedFormula — Bounded Arithmetical Formula","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)","book_abbrev":"62","label":"62-df-BoundedFormula","aliases":["62-df-BoundedFormula"],"display":"df-BoundedFormula — Bounded Arithmetical Formula","depends_on":["[[62-df-L2]]"],"source":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), Definitions I.7.1, II.1.1–II.1.2","source_pages":[23,24,63],"source_pdf_pages":[41,42,81]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"62"},{"key":"label","html":"62-df-BoundedFormula"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>62-df-BoundedFormula</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-BoundedFormula — Bounded Arithmetical Formula"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4c6d2d9f1999915f\" href=\"?note=4c6d2d9f1999915f\" title=\"62-df-L2\">62-df-L2</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), Definitions I.7.1, II.1.1–II.1.2"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>23</span><span>24</span><span>63</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>41</span><span>42</span><span>81</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>项、原子公式、变量与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}_1\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}_1\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4c6d2d9f1999915f\" href=\"?note=4c6d2d9f1999915f\" title=\"62-df-L2\">62-df-L2</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in V_N\">\\(x\\in V_N\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_{S_2}\">\\(t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_{S_2}\\)</span>，有界量词构造须满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\notin\\mathrm{FV}_1(t)\">\\(x\\notin\\mathrm{FV}_1(t)\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}BoundedFormula}\\vdash\\;\\begin{aligned}\nB_0&amp;=\\mathrm{AtFml}_{S_2},\\\\\nB_{k+1}&amp;=B_k\\cup\\{\\neg\\varphi,(\\varphi\\circ\\psi):\\varphi,\\psi\\in B_k\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{\\forall x&lt;t\\,\\varphi,\\exists x&lt;t\\,\\varphi:\\varphi\\in B_k,x\\notin\\mathrm{FV}_1(t)\\},\\\\\n\\Delta^0_0(S_2)&amp;\\coloneqq\\Sigma^0_0(S_2)\\coloneqq\\Pi^0_0(S_2)\\coloneqq\\bigcup_k B_k,\\\\\n\\forall x&lt;t\\,\\varphi&amp;\\coloneqq\\forall x(x&lt;t\\to\\varphi),\\quad\n\\exists x&lt;t\\,\\varphi\\coloneqq\\exists x(x&lt;t\\land\\varphi).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}BoundedFormula}\\vdash\\;\\begin{aligned}\nB_0&amp;=\\mathrm{AtFml}_{S_2},\\\\\nB_{k+1}&amp;=B_k\\cup\\{\\neg\\varphi,(\\varphi\\circ\\psi):\\varphi,\\psi\\in B_k\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{\\forall x&lt;t\\,\\varphi,\\exists x&lt;t\\,\\varphi:\\varphi\\in B_k,x\\notin\\mathrm{FV}_1(t)\\},\\\\\n\\Delta^0_0(S_2)&amp;\\coloneqq\\Sigma^0_0(S_2)\\coloneqq\\Pi^0_0(S_2)\\coloneqq\\bigcup_k B_k,\\\\\n\\forall x&lt;t\\,\\varphi&amp;\\coloneqq\\forall x(x&lt;t\\to\\varphi),\\quad\n\\exists x&lt;t\\,\\varphi\\coloneqq\\exists x(x&lt;t\\land\\varphi).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\leftrightarrow\\}\">\\(\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\leftrightarrow\\}\\)</span>。有界量词在分类时作为显示的语法缩写保留；展开后仍是合法 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_2\">\\(L_2\\)</span> 公式。补入上界项不含被量化变量的条件。有限阶段并集给出唯一最小闭包；集合自由参数允许出现，集合量词不允许出现。</p>\n<p>来源：第二版（2009），Definitions I.7.1, II.1.1–II.1.2；纸面页 23, 24, 63；PDF 页 41, 42, 81。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"62-df-L2","status":"resolved","id":"4c6d2d9f1999915f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-L2]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-L2","status":"resolved","id":"4c6d2d9f1999915f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"项、原子公式、变量与 $\\mathrm{FV}_1$ 见 [[62-df-L2]]。$x\\in V_N$、$t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_{S_2}$，有界量词构造须满足 $x\\notin\\mathrm{FV}_1(t)$。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{FV}_1","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in V_N","display":false},{"tex":"t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_{S_2}","display":false},{"tex":"x\\notin\\mathrm{FV}_1(t)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}BoundedFormula}\\vdash\\;\\begin{aligned}\nB_0&=\\mathrm{AtFml}_{S_2},\\\\\nB_{k+1}&=B_k\\cup\\{\\neg\\varphi,(\\varphi\\circ\\psi):\\varphi,\\psi\\in B_k\\}\\\\\n&\\quad\\cup\\{\\forall x<t\\,\\varphi,\\exists x<t\\,\\varphi:\\varphi\\in B_k,x\\notin\\mathrm{FV}_1(t)\\},\\\\\n\\Delta^0_0(S_2)&\\coloneqq\\Sigma^0_0(S_2)\\coloneqq\\Pi^0_0(S_2)\\coloneqq\\bigcup_k B_k,\\\\\n\\forall x<t\\,\\varphi&\\coloneqq\\forall x(x<t\\to\\varphi),\\quad\n\\exists x<t\\,\\varphi\\coloneqq\\exists x(x<t\\land\\varphi).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\leftrightarrow\\}","display":false},{"tex":"L_2","display":false}],"bytes":1588,"backlinks":[{"id":"eaea482f0ad24c81","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"有界公式类见 [[62-df-BoundedFormula]]，语法见 [[62-df-L2]]。$n\\in\\mathbb N$ 是元理论自然数；$\\bar x\\in V_N^{<\\omega}$ 为非空且变量互异的有限列，$\\exists\\bar x$、$\\forall\\bar x$ 表示依次量化。"},{"id":"c68a6ecbed6addff","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[62-df-BoundedFormula|Bounded Arithmetical Formula]]"}],"outgoing":["4c6d2d9f1999915f"]}